{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DogPunk is a sci-fi shooter set in a distant future where companies rush to create cutting-edge weapons to arm themselves and hurt others. In this high-octane first-person shooter, the player is a dog-headed super soldier trying to escape from containment by their captor, the Lab by Predator Tec. Battle through trials with various environments and enemies, and maneuver your character with the fluid parkour system.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/a97f955d0a68c6200f092e20f0ba3f13.avif?t=1772180691\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras_big/a97f955d0a68c6200f092e20f0ba3f13.webp?t=1772180691 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies and earn currency to upgrade your loadout. Mix and match over 30 active and passive abilities, and new weapons to aid your fight during your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Parkour Movement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/9e8d568af58cbae133e02a069ab91248.poster.avif?t=1772180691\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/9e8d568af58cbae133e02a069ab91248.webm?t=1772180691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/9e8d568af58cbae133e02a069ab91248.mp4?t=1772180691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain parkour movement into combat with dashes, wall runs, grapples, and vaults to maintain speed and control in every encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/4dfe6dc81d7d105514d4e5365edf1028.poster.avif?t=1772180691\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/4dfe6dc81d7d105514d4e5365edf1028.webm?t=1772180691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/4dfe6dc81d7d105514d4e5365edf1028.mp4?t=1772180691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between five different weapons based on your playstyle that give you an edge over the enemies. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/aee6a95efaf4afd06555a9210a1aa92d.poster.avif?t=1772180691\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/aee6a95efaf4afd06555a9210a1aa92d.webm?t=1772180691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/aee6a95efaf4afd06555a9210a1aa92d.mp4?t=1772180691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your loadout and select from 10 different active abilities, such as time dilation and gravitational surge. Use them in tandem with your movement to outmaneuver your enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/9a9e0ecc411d1e811a8e3d884d0eda32.poster.avif?t=1772180691\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/9a9e0ecc411d1e811a8e3d884d0eda32.webm?t=1772180691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/9a9e0ecc411d1e811a8e3d884d0eda32.mp4?t=1772180691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through three different chapters featuring over 30 different  levels and three major bosses.\u00a0Experience a mix of narrative-driven parkour sequences, intense combat arenas, and environments filled with lethal hazards\u2014each designed to challenge different aspects of mastery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/efce725d4176f56d30692ee031242ee2.poster.avif?t=1772180691\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/efce725d4176f56d30692ee031242ee2.webm?t=1772180691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/efce725d4176f56d30692ee031242ee2.mp4?t=1772180691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a mix of ranged, melee, aerial, and support enemies that constantly pressure your movement and force quick decisions. Variants add shields and dodges,  pushing you to switch abilities and reposition on the fly. Three boss fights bring everything together, testing your parkour, combat skills, and how well you\u2019ve built your loadout.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665510?t=1772180691","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665510?t=1772180691","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/4103e27baa2d25d2185e9297d5205549359cc1d4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772180691","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/4103e27baa2d25d2185e9297d5205549359cc1d4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772180691","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4420030,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DogPunk is a sci-fi shooter set in a distant future where companies rush to create cutting-edge weapons to arm themselves and hurt others. In this high-octane first-person shooter, the player is a dog-headed super soldier trying to escape from containment by their captor, the Lab by Predator Tec. Battle through trials with various environments and enemies, and maneuver your character with the fluid parkour system.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/a97f955d0a68c6200f092e20f0ba3f13.avif?t=1772180691\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras_big/a97f955d0a68c6200f092e20f0ba3f13.webp?t=1772180691 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies and earn currency to upgrade your loadout. Mix and match over 30 active and passive abilities, and new weapons to aid your fight during your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Parkour Movement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/9e8d568af58cbae133e02a069ab91248.poster.avif?t=1772180691\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/9e8d568af58cbae133e02a069ab91248.webm?t=1772180691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/9e8d568af58cbae133e02a069ab91248.mp4?t=1772180691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain parkour movement into combat with dashes, wall runs, grapples, and vaults to maintain speed and control in every encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/4dfe6dc81d7d105514d4e5365edf1028.poster.avif?t=1772180691\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/4dfe6dc81d7d105514d4e5365edf1028.webm?t=1772180691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/4dfe6dc81d7d105514d4e5365edf1028.mp4?t=1772180691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between five different weapons based on your playstyle that give you an edge over the enemies. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/aee6a95efaf4afd06555a9210a1aa92d.poster.avif?t=1772180691\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/aee6a95efaf4afd06555a9210a1aa92d.webm?t=1772180691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/aee6a95efaf4afd06555a9210a1aa92d.mp4?t=1772180691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your loadout and select from 10 different active abilities, such as time dilation and gravitational surge. Use them in tandem with your movement to outmaneuver your enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/9a9e0ecc411d1e811a8e3d884d0eda32.poster.avif?t=1772180691\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/9a9e0ecc411d1e811a8e3d884d0eda32.webm?t=1772180691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/9a9e0ecc411d1e811a8e3d884d0eda32.mp4?t=1772180691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through three different chapters featuring over 30 different  levels and three major bosses.\u00a0Experience a mix of narrative-driven parkour sequences, intense combat arenas, and environments filled with lethal hazards\u2014each designed to challenge different aspects of mastery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/efce725d4176f56d30692ee031242ee2.poster.avif?t=1772180691\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/efce725d4176f56d30692ee031242ee2.webm?t=1772180691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/efce725d4176f56d30692ee031242ee2.mp4?t=1772180691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a mix of ranged, melee, aerial, and support enemies that constantly pressure your movement and force quick decisions. Variants add shields and dodges,  pushing you to switch abilities and reposition on the fly. Three boss fights bring everything together, testing your parkour, combat skills, and how well you\u2019ve built your loadout.</p>","developers":["DogPunk Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/439444e96061a454fe3751f8c7c4d7a8145706b7/header.jpg?t=1772180691","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong>